# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
# RLM-Anchor: Separate PRODUCT files from USER DATA
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# PRODUCT (tracked in git):
#   - workflows, scripts, skills
#   - template _index.md, _template.md, README.md
#   - 13_preferences/ template files
#   - MEMORY_INDEX.md, VERSION
#
# USER DATA (ignored by git):
#   - Memory entries created by /remember
#   - Session history from /sleep
#   - Walkthroughs from /walkthrough
#   - Backups from /anchor_backup
#   - Stats log from /memory-stats
#
# NOTE: _index.md files are tracked as clean templates.
#       Use `git update-index --skip-worktree` to hide
#       local changes when you add user entries.
#       See: .agent/scripts/gitignore_setup.sh
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── User-created memory entries ──
# (files created by /remember in categories 01-12)
.agent/memory/01_project/*.md
!.agent/memory/01_project/_index.md

.agent/memory/02_architecture/*.md
!.agent/memory/02_architecture/_index.md

.agent/memory/03_decisions/*.md
!.agent/memory/03_decisions/_index.md
!.agent/memory/03_decisions/_template.md

.agent/memory/04_domain/*.md
!.agent/memory/04_domain/_index.md

.agent/memory/05_code/*.md
!.agent/memory/05_code/_index.md

.agent/memory/06_problems/*.md
.agent/memory/06_problems/**/*.md
!.agent/memory/06_problems/_index.md
!.agent/memory/06_problems/_template.md
!.agent/memory/06_problems/bugs/README.md
!.agent/memory/06_problems/workarounds/README.md

.agent/memory/07_context/*.md
!.agent/memory/07_context/_index.md
!.agent/memory/07_context/current_session.md
!.agent/memory/07_context/pending_tasks.md

.agent/memory/08_people/*.md
!.agent/memory/08_people/_index.md

.agent/memory/09_external/*.md
!.agent/memory/09_external/_index.md

.agent/memory/10_testing/*.md
!.agent/memory/10_testing/_index.md

.agent/memory/11_deployment/*.md
!.agent/memory/11_deployment/_index.md

.agent/memory/12_roadmap/*.md
!.agent/memory/12_roadmap/_index.md

# ── Session history (created by /sleep) ──
.agent/memory/07_context/session_history/

# ── Walkthroughs (created by /walkthrough) ──
.agent/memory/07_context/walkthroughs/

# ── Memory stats log (updated by /memory-stats) ──
.agent/memory/07_context/memory_stats_log.md

# ── Backups (created by /anchor_backup) ──
.agent/backups/

# ── Local language override (never push to GitHub) ──
.agent/memory/13_preferences/language_local.md

# ── OS / IDE artifacts ──
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

ADVANCED_MEMORY_SYSTEM_RU.md
REDDIT_POST.md
ESSAY.md
ESSAY_EN.md
COMMANDS_RU.md
ADVANCED_MEMORY_SYSTEM_RU.md
ADVANCED_MEMORY_SYSTEM_UK.md
docs_backup/*